# React files

- Function components only. One component per file, and the filename is PascalCase.
- Pages do not generate puzzles or build PDFs. Call a hook, then render.
- UI primitives stay unaware of crosswords and word searches.
- Use Tailwind utilities. Do not add a CSS file per component.

```tsx
export function ToolPage ({ title, editor }: ToolPageProps) {
  return (
    <section>
      <h1>{title}</h1>
      {editor}
    </section>
  )
}
```
